      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Relocating in Cuddalore requires a seamless, professional approach to ensure your belongings arrive safely and efficiently. A trusted packers and movers service begins with a meticulous pre-move assessment. This initial phase involves either a physical survey of your residence or a detailed video assessment if the move is long-distance.</p>
<p>During this step, our team evaluates the volume of goods, identifies fragile items, and checks for any structural constraints like narrow staircases or tight elevator spaces. This data allows us to provide an accurate quote and plan the logistics, ensuring no surprises on moving day.</p>
